{"unit_id":"66rapper__dsh-model-auto-enricher#card-zh","repo":"66rapper/dsh-model-auto-enricher","commit":"db011fe106a4d12b9c23128ac4ead3f1705b6fcd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 模型补齐助手是一款面向 DSH Web 的模型配置插件。它在宿主侧监听模型设置保存和配置重载事件，并在设置页提供模型补齐面板。插件可扫描各渠道的模型，补充上下文窗口、最大输出、多模态输入和推理档位；也支持手动预览、批量补齐、查看待处理状态和安全停用。补齐时按规则保留更大的既有数值与自定义档位，写入前备份配置文件。适合需要快速完善 DSH 模型规格的用户；无需 API Key，需让插件访问 DSH profile 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:273-380","lib/core.js:598-676","lib/core.js:842-913","lib/client.js:948-971"]}
{"unit_id":"66rapper__dsh-model-auto-enricher#card-en","repo":"66rapper/dsh-model-auto-enricher","commit":"db011fe106a4d12b9c23128ac4ead3f1705b6fcd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Model Auto Enricher watches model settings and adds a panel to DSH web. It fills context, output, image input, and reasoning fields. Users can inspect, preview, or apply bulk updates. It preserves larger values and custom tiers, and backs up the profile before writing. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:273-380","lib/core.js:598-676","lib/core.js:842-913","lib/client.js:948-971"]}
